+//   QK: nope = fp8 16x16x32 MFMA + software per-64-tile scale; rope = bf16 MFMA.
+//   Softmax: smem-mediated online (per head), per-head sink finalize.
+//   PV: dequant V (nope*scale ++ rope) -> bf16 smem, bf16 16x16x32 MFMA.
